### Claude Code ###
# This repo tracks its Claude Code pipeline assets, overriding the user's global
# ~/.config/git/ignore rules (.claude/skills/*, .claude/agents/*, .claude/scripts/*, .claude/rules/*).
!.claude/
!.claude/**
# ...except per-user local settings, which stay untracked.
.claude/settings.local.json